WEBVTT

00:01:31.220 --> 00:01:34.610
Today's episode is all about 
Lee and his teammates.

00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:39.470
Get him!

00:01:51.330 --> 00:01:54.710
<i>If I'm to become a great ninja
despite not being able to use ninjutsu,</i>

00:01:55.210 --> 00:01:57.970
<i>I can't afford to lose to anyone.</i>

00:01:58.440 --> 00:02:00.410
Man, if the boss were here...

00:02:00.410 --> 00:02:01.800
Yeah.

00:02:01.800 --> 00:02:03.670
<i>No matter who my opponents are,</i>

00:02:03.670 --> 00:02:05.650
<i>if I can beat all these ninjas,</i>

00:02:05.650 --> 00:02:07.230
<i>no one can stop me!</i>

00:02:07.230 --> 00:02:09.280
<i>Even my genius teammate, Neji,</i>

00:02:09.280 --> 00:02:11.490
<i>would've have a hard time 
defeating all of them.</i>

00:02:23.400 --> 00:02:24.950
B-Boss!

00:02:25.810 --> 00:02:27.870
We're sorry!

00:02:29.150 --> 00:02:30.210
What's wrong, Lee?

00:02:32.490 --> 00:02:34.210
Quality over quantity?!

00:02:40.220 --> 00:02:44.220
<b>A Competition with the 
Genius Ninja, Neji</b>

00:02:46.460 --> 00:02:47.960
Hey, look!

00:02:47.960 --> 00:02:49.510
It's him!

00:02:49.510 --> 00:02:53.640
I heard he beat a ninja boss from the
Hidden Grass village in one second!

00:02:53.640 --> 00:02:55.080
Wow!

00:02:55.080 --> 00:02:56.730
He's so cool!

00:02:56.730 --> 00:02:59.120
This is Neji Hyuga,

00:02:59.120 --> 00:03:02.240
a member of Lee's team that people
refer to as a genius ninja.

00:03:02.240 --> 00:03:05.970
Bah! I could've beaten 
that boss on my own, too.

00:03:07.070 --> 00:03:08.000
Tenten?

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:10.230
Where could it be?

00:03:10.230 --> 00:03:11.300
What's going on?

00:03:11.300 --> 00:03:14.240
Oh, I dropped an important picture 
around here somewhere.

00:03:14.240 --> 00:03:15.810
Oh, no!

00:03:15.810 --> 00:03:16.960
We must find it!

00:03:16.960 --> 00:03:19.150
Yeah. Oh, I should just ask Neji.

00:03:19.150 --> 00:03:20.890
He could find it with his Byakugan!

00:03:22.220 --> 00:03:23.260
For those who don't know,

00:03:23.260 --> 00:03:28.300
the Byakugan is an ability of Neji's
that lets him see through objects,

00:03:28.300 --> 00:03:30.370
and search for things 
from great distances.

00:03:30.370 --> 00:03:31.690
Couldn't breathe...

00:03:33.400 --> 00:03:34.740
Neji again?!

00:03:34.740 --> 00:03:35.860
Yup.

00:03:35.860 --> 00:03:37.660
L-Leave it to me!

00:03:37.660 --> 00:03:39.770
The truth is, I can use the Byakugan, too.

00:03:45.600 --> 00:03:47.480
Byakugan!

00:03:47.480 --> 00:03:50.290
Just showing the whites of your eyes
doesn't give you Byakugan!

00:03:51.880 --> 00:03:54.160
Sakura-san, Naruto-kun.

00:03:55.690 --> 00:03:58.410
H-Hey! Who are you, you weirdo?!

00:03:59.520 --> 00:04:01.540
I-It's me!

00:04:01.540 --> 00:04:03.260
That's such a suspicious response.

00:04:03.650 --> 00:04:07.990
Come on, Lee, you know you 
can't use the Byakugan.

00:04:07.990 --> 00:04:10.780
You can't even use ordinary ninjutsu.

00:04:10.780 --> 00:04:13.230
Besides, Neji's a genius.

00:04:13.480 --> 00:04:15.160
I know.

00:04:15.160 --> 00:04:18.840
That's why I've worked so hard to perfect
my hand-to-hand fighting skills.

00:04:19.380 --> 00:04:20.150
But I...

00:04:20.150 --> 00:04:22.820
I want to beat Neji!

00:04:23.260 --> 00:04:24.300
Lee...

00:04:24.300 --> 00:04:25.640
Bushy-Brows...

00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:29.700
I wondered where you guys went.
What are you doing here?

00:04:29.700 --> 00:04:32.500
Neji, I lost something around here.

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:35.500
<i>I have to find the picture before Neji!</i>

00:04:35.500 --> 00:04:37.520
Is this it? I found it on the ground.

00:04:38.410 --> 00:04:40.610
Wow! That took you no time at all!

00:04:40.610 --> 00:04:42.510
Hey, it's an old pic of you guys!

00:04:43.600 --> 00:04:44.970
Let me see!

00:04:45.520 --> 00:04:46.990
I'm going home.

00:04:51.490 --> 00:04:54.540
Neji was a real brat back then.

00:04:54.540 --> 00:04:58.570
His words were like a knife, 
sharp and painful.

00:04:59.180 --> 00:05:03.120
<i>You're not a ninja if 
you can't use ninjutsu.</i>

00:05:04.310 --> 00:05:06.660
<i>What are you, an idiot?</i>

00:05:06.660 --> 00:05:08.580
He said a lot of stuff like that.

00:05:08.580 --> 00:05:10.120
That's not what I was talking about!

00:05:12.110 --> 00:05:15.540
<i>You're not a ninja if you 
can't use a credit card.</i>

00:05:16.440 --> 00:05:18.670
<i>What are you, a middle schooler?</i>

00:05:19.720 --> 00:05:23.680
Nuh-uh! Besides, ninjas don't use credit!

00:05:23.680 --> 00:05:27.530
Nowadays Neji's a much 
more well-rounded person,

00:05:27.530 --> 00:05:29.240
and very cooperative.

00:05:29.240 --> 00:05:31.380
He's become a dependable teammate.

00:05:31.380 --> 00:05:33.620
He was already a prodigy,

00:05:33.620 --> 00:05:35.720
and now without the personality issues,

00:05:35.720 --> 00:05:38.690
he'll probably achieve 
even greater things.

00:05:38.690 --> 00:05:39.890
Pretty cool.

00:05:39.890 --> 00:05:41.070
What'd she say?!

00:05:41.470 --> 00:05:44.570
For some reason I don't like the
idea of Neji being a big deal!

00:05:45.350 --> 00:05:49.370
We'll just see how great he is!

00:06:11.810 --> 00:06:13.980
Talk about a big deal.

00:06:13.980 --> 00:06:16.890
It's another gift the gods 
bestowed upon him...

00:06:16.890 --> 00:06:18.130
What're you talking about?

00:06:18.130 --> 00:06:20.150
What happened to you two?

00:06:20.150 --> 00:06:24.960
Neji wears boxers and I'm 
still in tighty-whities!

00:06:24.960 --> 00:06:25.910
Is that all?!

00:06:25.910 --> 00:06:27.930
Just go buy your own boxers!

00:06:27.930 --> 00:06:30.860
He's more... he's more of a man than me.

00:06:30.860 --> 00:06:33.910
Forget manliness. It looks 
like he's broken your brains.

00:06:34.580 --> 00:06:37.700
No! I won't admit defeat yet!

00:06:38.140 --> 00:06:39.370
I have only one choice...

00:06:39.990 --> 00:06:41.860
Neji, I want to fight you!

00:06:41.860 --> 00:06:43.130
What?!

00:06:43.130 --> 00:06:46.550
I'm not yet convinced that
you're superior to me.

00:06:47.020 --> 00:06:49.130
Stop this foolishness. Come on.

00:06:49.840 --> 00:06:50.720
I see.

00:06:51.240 --> 00:06:53.680
You're afraid I'll win, aren't you?

00:06:54.940 --> 00:06:56.390
Afraid?

00:07:00.100 --> 00:07:01.540
Bring it on.

00:07:01.540 --> 00:07:04.830
You think you can beat me 
without any ninjutsu, Lee?

00:07:04.830 --> 00:07:06.150
Absolutely.

00:07:06.480 --> 00:07:08.740
<i>This looks like a real fight.</i>

00:07:08.740 --> 00:07:10.410
The fight is in one week.

00:07:10.410 --> 00:07:11.410
Any time, any place!

00:07:11.410 --> 00:07:13.580
I will win!

00:07:14.350 --> 00:07:16.690
Are you gonna be okay, Lee?

00:07:17.270 --> 00:07:18.750
I don't know.

00:07:18.750 --> 00:07:20.890
But I've got one week to train.

00:07:20.890 --> 00:07:23.380
I can at least grow a bit in that time.

00:07:23.380 --> 00:07:27.730
I'll prove that with enough hardwork, 
one can surpass a genius!

00:07:29.300 --> 00:07:31.470
Well said, Bushy-Brows!

00:07:32.030 --> 00:07:35.910
I'll even help you with your training,
 just this once!

00:07:35.910 --> 00:07:37.180
Naruto-kun!

00:07:37.530 --> 00:07:40.150
Let's do it!

00:07:40.150 --> 00:07:41.640
Yeah!

00:07:44.640 --> 00:07:46.610
One week later.

00:07:47.350 --> 00:07:51.760
<i>Lee said he could improve a bit,</i>

00:07:51.760 --> 00:07:54.610
<i>but one week's not a very long time.</i>

00:07:54.610 --> 00:07:56.030
Sorry I'm late!

00:08:02.400 --> 00:08:04.520
W-W-What happened to you?!

00:08:04.520 --> 00:08:07.140
I underwent grueling training 
with Naruto-kun,

00:08:07.140 --> 00:08:09.770
and I grew a bit, and then a bit more!

00:08:09.770 --> 00:08:12.130
You just grew, period!

00:08:12.820 --> 00:08:15.180
Well? Do I look different?

00:08:15.180 --> 00:08:16.050
Very different!

00:08:18.030 --> 00:08:20.060
You did a great job, Bushy-Brows.

00:08:20.750 --> 00:08:21.560
<i>Oh, no...</i>

00:08:22.100 --> 00:08:23.060
<i>Not Naruto, too...</i>

00:08:24.170 --> 00:08:26.050
Why is it only your right arm?!

00:08:26.510 --> 00:08:29.820
Well, I said I'd help out with his training,

00:08:29.820 --> 00:08:32.160
but I figured I'd only do half as much.

00:08:32.160 --> 00:08:34.200
For the love of god, why?!

00:08:34.960 --> 00:08:36.160
Well?

00:08:37.130 --> 00:08:38.400
Do I look different?

00:08:38.400 --> 00:08:39.410
Very different!

00:08:39.890 --> 00:08:41.540
Anyways...

00:08:41.970 --> 00:08:45.600
This match is Rock Lee versus Neji Hyuga.

00:08:45.600 --> 00:08:46.750
Fight!

00:08:51.510 --> 00:08:52.770
Wow!

00:08:52.770 --> 00:08:54.070
Lee-san's dodging them all!

00:08:54.470 --> 00:08:57.390
<i>I see, so you really did go 
through some hard training.</i>

00:08:59.470 --> 00:09:00.600
Up here!

00:09:01.370 --> 00:09:04.730
All that extra bulk has 
slowed you down, Lee!

00:09:05.600 --> 00:09:07.100
Don't panic, Bushy-Brows!

00:09:07.100 --> 00:09:09.440
Remember that harsh training!

00:09:09.910 --> 00:09:11.320
<i>Naruto-kun...</i>

00:09:17.160 --> 00:09:18.510
<i>Right...</i>

00:09:18.510 --> 00:09:21.520
<i>All that blood, sweat, and tears...</i>

00:09:21.520 --> 00:09:24.500
<i>I endured and endured and endured.</i>

00:09:22.430 --> 00:09:24.500
Leaf
A*tro

00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:26.290
<i>And survived!</i>

00:09:27.650 --> 00:09:29.110
Fight your way to
Koshi Stadium, Lee!
- Sakura Haruno

00:09:29.110 --> 00:09:31.190
Take Us To
Koshi Stadium

00:09:32.040 --> 00:09:34.150
<i>I can't lose!</i>

00:09:34.150 --> 00:09:36.470
I guess playing the straight 
man is pointless now...

00:09:36.730 --> 00:09:38.820
Get ready, Neji!

00:09:39.760 --> 00:09:42.110
Fire Fork Ball!

00:09:42.110 --> 00:09:43.000
I can't take it!

00:09:50.450 --> 00:09:51.820
The Replacement Jutsu?!

00:09:51.820 --> 00:09:52.820
When did he—

00:09:54.500 --> 00:09:55.610
You're mine, Lee!

00:09:56.010 --> 00:09:57.990
Eight Trigrams, Sixty-four Strikes!

00:09:58.360 --> 00:10:01.080
<i>He's lost speed, but those muscles...</i>

00:10:01.080 --> 00:10:03.730
<i>He's not budging even the 
teeniest, tiniest bit.</i>

00:10:05.590 --> 00:10:08.500
Hey, you're leaking some kind of air!

00:10:11.480 --> 00:10:14.120
<i>No. I'm losing strength.</i>

00:10:14.780 --> 00:10:16.670
<i>I've gotta bet it all on this one!</i>

00:10:20.090 --> 00:10:22.140
I have to use that technique...

00:10:23.240 --> 00:10:24.530
Byakugan!

00:10:24.530 --> 00:10:25.980
No, no, no! That's just pointless!

00:10:27.250 --> 00:10:28.470
What is that?

00:10:28.470 --> 00:10:29.650
Why are you surprised?!

00:10:30.630 --> 00:10:33.460
<i>Why is he making that face?</i>

00:10:33.460 --> 00:10:35.110
<i>I don't understand, it makes no sense!</i>

00:10:35.470 --> 00:10:38.530
It makes no sense that 
you'd be worried about it!

00:10:38.850 --> 00:10:40.490
Neji's wide open!

00:10:40.490 --> 00:10:41.530
Nail him, Bushy-Brows!

00:10:42.070 --> 00:10:43.530
This is it!

00:10:43.530 --> 00:10:44.620
No!

00:10:44.620 --> 00:10:46.990
Eight Trigrams, Sixty-four Headbutts!

00:10:46.990 --> 00:10:48.620
What are you doing?!

00:10:49.080 --> 00:10:51.450
<i>That's a ton of headbutts.</i>

00:10:51.450 --> 00:10:54.260
<i>This is crazy, Lee's going to win...</i>

00:10:55.130 --> 00:10:57.720
Hey, Lee took a crazy 
amount of damage, too!

00:11:00.940 --> 00:11:04.190
In the end, I couldn't beat Neji.

00:11:04.800 --> 00:11:08.030
Lee, you've been 
challenging me for years,

00:11:08.030 --> 00:11:09.920
and you lose every time.

00:11:10.590 --> 00:11:13.280
But you've put in unbelievable 
amounts of hard work,

00:11:13.280 --> 00:11:14.670
continued to challenge me,

00:11:14.670 --> 00:11:16.850
and now you fought me to a draw.

00:11:18.210 --> 00:11:21.210
You're a genius of hard work,
 and a great ninja.

00:11:23.190 --> 00:11:24.030
Neji...

00:11:24.030 --> 00:11:26.010
That's right!

00:11:26.010 --> 00:11:27.700
I won't let you guys upstage me, either!

00:11:27.700 --> 00:11:30.000
I'll train until I can beat you both!

00:11:30.220 --> 00:11:31.820
I won't lose either!

00:11:31.820 --> 00:11:32.580
Neither will I!

00:11:33.490 --> 00:11:36.160
It's kinda nice seeing 
guys get along like that.

00:11:36.160 --> 00:11:38.590
They're simple-minded, 
but in an innocent way.

00:11:39.250 --> 00:11:41.110
One week later.

00:11:41.550 --> 00:11:44.860
Today I will live my 
youth at full power!

00:11:44.860 --> 00:11:45.470
Yeah!

00:11:45.860 --> 00:11:47.600
No way!

00:11:48.040 --> 00:11:52.240
Lee's hot-blooded hard work 
moved even Neji's cool heart.

00:11:52.240 --> 00:11:55.360
Just don't let him influence 
you too much, kids!

00:12:01.870 --> 00:12:05.160
Everyone knows the 
phrase, "Ladies first."

00:12:05.800 --> 00:12:07.870
It signifies the idea that men
should be kind to women,

00:12:07.870 --> 00:12:10.370
and behave like gentlemen
in their presence.

00:12:10.890 --> 00:12:12.950
Do your best, guys!

00:12:13.820 --> 00:12:16.340
It's time for me to end this.

00:12:17.030 --> 00:12:19.210
One or two extra days of training 
won't be enough to beat me!

00:12:19.630 --> 00:12:20.910
You're too overconfident.

00:12:20.910 --> 00:12:24.300
I'm a completely new man today!

00:12:24.300 --> 00:12:25.300
And that's because...

00:12:28.400 --> 00:12:31.420
I've graduated from
tighty-whities to boxers!

00:12:31.420 --> 00:12:32.960
For a young man going through puberty,

00:12:32.960 --> 00:12:34.620
this is an indispensable 
part of becoming an adult!

00:12:34.620 --> 00:12:36.060
I see, so you've moved up, too!

00:12:36.750 --> 00:12:38.400
What is wrong with you two?!

00:12:41.290 --> 00:12:42.740
Jeez.

00:12:48.640 --> 00:12:52.750
<b>Tenten's Must-Win Battle</b>

00:12:53.030 --> 00:12:56.280
I can't believe you just dropped 
your pants right in front of me.

00:12:56.280 --> 00:12:59.970
I'm a girl, you guys need 
to keep that in mind.

00:12:59.970 --> 00:13:02.520
Keep it in mind? How so?

00:13:02.520 --> 00:13:03.940
Don't you get it?

00:13:03.940 --> 00:13:07.430
You need to act more 
gentlemanly around me.

00:13:08.020 --> 00:13:09.350
Gentle...

00:13:09.740 --> 00:13:10.860
...melody?

00:13:10.860 --> 00:13:12.350
Gently, I...

00:13:13.030 --> 00:13:14.150
Not melody!

00:13:14.150 --> 00:13:15.600
Manly, gentlemanly!

00:13:16.620 --> 00:13:19.940
Stop acting like morons.
Let's get back to the mission!

00:13:26.030 --> 00:13:29.940
Take this, mountain bandits!

00:13:33.840 --> 00:13:35.320
Nice work.

00:13:35.320 --> 00:13:37.420
Looks like we weren't needed.

00:13:39.630 --> 00:13:41.100
She's so strong!

00:13:41.100 --> 00:13:42.300
Retreat is better than defeat!

00:13:43.520 --> 00:13:46.810
What are you silly boys saying?

00:13:46.810 --> 00:13:48.620
B-Boss!

00:13:48.620 --> 00:13:51.600
You can't even defeat that little child?

00:13:52.270 --> 00:13:53.220
Excuse me.

00:13:53.780 --> 00:13:55.810
Who are you calling a child?

00:13:56.120 --> 00:13:58.710
What a cute little girl.

00:13:58.710 --> 00:14:00.980
But you're acting up, aren't you?

00:14:00.980 --> 00:14:02.300
She sure is!

00:14:02.300 --> 00:14:03.150
Big time, big time!

00:14:03.930 --> 00:14:05.610
You're making me angry.

00:14:05.610 --> 00:14:07.150
Oh, how scary!

00:14:07.150 --> 00:14:09.410
How dare you do that to our boss?!

00:14:09.410 --> 00:14:10.410
Yeah, yeah!

00:14:10.410 --> 00:14:12.830
I haven't done anything yet.

00:14:12.830 --> 00:14:15.010
You scared our boss.

00:14:15.010 --> 00:14:16.410
You'll pay for this!

00:14:16.410 --> 00:14:19.170
My dear lackeys will always...

00:14:19.170 --> 00:14:21.840
...put their bodies on the line for me!

00:14:22.460 --> 00:14:26.040
They'd throw themselves into 
water or even fire for me!

00:14:27.460 --> 00:14:28.460
How dare you...

00:14:28.460 --> 00:14:29.950
...scare our boss?!

00:14:29.950 --> 00:14:31.650
<i>They're like completely 
different people now!</i>

00:14:31.650 --> 00:14:32.680
Lee, Neji!

00:14:33.340 --> 00:14:34.280
Yes?

00:14:35.780 --> 00:14:40.270
How pitiful. You can't get 
the men to protect you!

00:14:42.330 --> 00:14:43.150
You two...

00:14:43.860 --> 00:14:45.860
Jerks!

00:14:45.860 --> 00:14:49.130
Jerks! Jerks! Jerks!

00:14:51.800 --> 00:14:54.330
I was in trouble and 
you didn't even care!

00:14:54.690 --> 00:14:55.480
Well...

00:14:55.480 --> 00:14:57.620
We thought you had it 
under control, Tenten.

00:14:57.620 --> 00:15:01.040
So did I, but...

00:15:01.440 --> 00:15:06.050
<i>How pitiful, you can't get 
the men to protect you!</i>

00:15:06.670 --> 00:15:09.450
I'd appreciate it if you 
paid more attention.

00:15:09.450 --> 00:15:13.010
I mean, I'm a girl, you know...

00:15:13.280 --> 00:15:15.090
Hold on a second.

00:15:15.090 --> 00:15:16.900
We're still sweaty from that mission.

00:15:16.900 --> 00:15:19.220
That's what I'm talking about!

00:15:21.330 --> 00:15:22.900
So, um...

00:15:23.340 --> 00:15:26.860
You want us to act more 
gentlemanly around you, right?

00:15:26.860 --> 00:15:27.900
Yes.

00:15:27.900 --> 00:15:31.720
It will help improve our teamwork, too.

00:15:33.470 --> 00:15:36.080
Understood. We'll do our best.

00:15:38.500 --> 00:15:39.680
Welcome,

00:15:39.680 --> 00:15:40.540
mademoiselle.

00:15:43.780 --> 00:15:46.030
Are you sure about this, Lee?

00:15:46.030 --> 00:15:47.270
Yes!

00:15:47.270 --> 00:15:49.200
I researched this very thoroughly!

00:15:55.420 --> 00:15:57.370
You must be tired, mademoiselle.

00:15:57.370 --> 00:15:59.680
Please, sit down.

00:15:59.680 --> 00:16:00.760
Enjoy yourself.

00:16:00.760 --> 00:16:01.600
This is kinda nice.

00:16:02.090 --> 00:16:06.290
<i>They're pretty capable 
when they really try!</i>

00:16:06.290 --> 00:16:10.240
We've prepared a special 
treat for you, mademoiselle.

00:16:10.940 --> 00:16:13.710
Two sweet cakes for table four!

00:16:13.710 --> 00:16:15.560
Sweet cakes, sweet breaks,

00:16:15.560 --> 00:16:16.780
we do what it takes!

00:16:16.780 --> 00:16:18.370
Sweet cakes, sweet breaks,

00:16:18.370 --> 00:16:19.290
time to raise the stakes!

00:16:20.100 --> 00:16:21.750
That's enough!

00:16:22.090 --> 00:16:26.170
Look, I didn't say you need 
to wait on me hand and foot.

00:16:26.170 --> 00:16:29.460
Boys should defend girls. 
That's what's important!

00:16:30.350 --> 00:16:32.130
Protect... them?

00:16:33.320 --> 00:16:36.720
The Five Great Nations
Cup Championship...

00:16:36.720 --> 00:16:38.640
...is down to the last penalty kick!

00:16:38.990 --> 00:16:42.240
Everyone in the stadium is 
on the edge of their seat!

00:16:42.240 --> 00:16:44.560
<i>Tenten... watch me.</i>

00:16:44.850 --> 00:16:46.940
Hyuga shoots!

00:16:47.740 --> 00:16:49.730
No, Lee goes the other way!

00:16:51.000 --> 00:16:53.650
He kicked it! He blocked 
the ball with his foot!

00:16:54.030 --> 00:16:55.910
I said girls, not goals!

00:16:55.910 --> 00:16:59.880
No, it was the story of a
boy keeping his promise...

00:16:59.880 --> 00:17:03.480
...to a girl by defending the goal—

00:17:03.480 --> 00:17:04.620
Enough!

00:17:06.660 --> 00:17:07.920
W-We failed...

00:17:07.920 --> 00:17:10.300
My groin... I can't feel my groin...

00:17:10.300 --> 00:17:13.170
Men. It must be nice being 
such simple-minded creatures.

00:17:13.650 --> 00:17:15.260
Wait, that's it!

00:17:18.500 --> 00:17:21.140
We just need to make you a boy!

00:17:21.990 --> 00:17:24.100
That actually makes sense.

00:17:24.720 --> 00:17:25.810
Let's get to work!

00:17:26.430 --> 00:17:28.470
You simply must have a mustache.

00:17:28.470 --> 00:17:29.350
Mustache?!

00:17:29.350 --> 00:17:30.620
How about a comb over?

00:17:30.620 --> 00:17:31.610
Comb over?!

00:17:31.610 --> 00:17:34.720
And the coup de grace, old man stink.

00:17:35.580 --> 00:17:36.990
Perfect!

00:17:38.290 --> 00:17:40.330
Classic style!

00:17:40.940 --> 00:17:42.300
Pretty good.

00:17:42.300 --> 00:17:46.130
You'd have to be an idiot 
to mistake me for a chick.

00:17:47.690 --> 00:17:50.710
Wait, you two are the idiots!

00:17:51.820 --> 00:17:52.880
W-Why?

00:17:53.530 --> 00:17:57.080
I get it. I just need to 
stop caring that you two...

00:17:57.080 --> 00:17:58.680
...aren't gonna treat me like a woman.

00:17:59.150 --> 00:18:01.380
It's my own fault for getting upset.

00:18:01.870 --> 00:18:04.560
I really don't understand.

00:18:04.560 --> 00:18:05.390
What?

00:18:05.790 --> 00:18:09.860
I've always depended on you because
I know how strong you are.

00:18:10.500 --> 00:18:13.150
But you say I should be protecting you?

00:18:16.400 --> 00:18:17.360
I dunno.

00:18:17.790 --> 00:18:18.830
Tenten...

00:18:20.330 --> 00:18:22.240
What did we do wrong?

00:18:22.240 --> 00:18:23.390
No clue.

00:18:24.420 --> 00:18:25.300
Oh, no!

00:18:25.300 --> 00:18:26.230
What?

00:18:26.230 --> 00:18:28.370
I forgot the most important part.

00:18:28.370 --> 00:18:31.500
Tenten can't be seen in that outfit!

00:18:33.530 --> 00:18:35.710
<i>I really don't understand.</i>

00:18:36.310 --> 00:18:40.330
<i>I've always depended on you because
I know how strong you are.</i>

00:18:41.150 --> 00:18:43.010
Hey, bro.

00:18:43.500 --> 00:18:44.900
Give us all your money.

00:18:44.900 --> 00:18:46.850
Or we'll mess you up.

00:18:47.130 --> 00:18:49.500
You're those guys from before!

00:18:49.500 --> 00:18:52.610
Oh, my, it's the little 
girl from earlier!

00:18:53.360 --> 00:18:56.430
Were you so mad the boys ignored you...

00:18:56.430 --> 00:18:59.460
...that you decided to turn 
into a boy yourself?

00:18:59.460 --> 00:19:01.790
That's right. I'm a guy now.

00:19:01.790 --> 00:19:04.370
I can fight on my own.
I don't need anyone protecting me!

00:19:04.850 --> 00:19:06.910
We'll see about that.

00:19:06.910 --> 00:19:08.280
Get him!

00:19:20.890 --> 00:19:22.220
<i>I...</i>

00:19:22.750 --> 00:19:25.980
<i>I... can fight on my own!</i>

00:19:25.980 --> 00:19:27.220
Tenten!

00:19:28.180 --> 00:19:29.390
Lee, Neji!

00:19:29.690 --> 00:19:31.600
It's not gonna work!

00:19:31.810 --> 00:19:33.810
Tenten, that outfit's pointless!

00:19:34.980 --> 00:19:37.740
You forgot something very important!

00:19:38.290 --> 00:19:39.270
Lee...

00:19:39.270 --> 00:19:44.000
<i>I should've been grateful 
for your faith in me!</i>

00:19:49.320 --> 00:19:51.310
We forgot the underwear!

00:19:51.310 --> 00:19:54.210
With those, you'll be all man!

00:19:59.680 --> 00:20:02.360
Oh, dear me, right when they
should've been defending you,

00:20:02.360 --> 00:20:04.430
they made you a laughingstock instead!

00:20:04.430 --> 00:20:05.300
Hey.

00:20:06.350 --> 00:20:08.020
Get over yourself,

00:20:10.190 --> 00:20:12.190
you old hag!

00:20:14.190 --> 00:20:19.280
Don't put me on the same level as you!

00:20:24.420 --> 00:20:29.460
Why? Women have a right 
to be protected...

00:20:29.460 --> 00:20:31.870
We're not entitled to anything.

00:20:32.280 --> 00:20:37.300
Man or woman, my only goal 
is to become a strong ninja!

00:20:39.660 --> 00:20:44.800
Tenten, you haven't told us to 
act more gentlemanly in a while.

00:20:44.800 --> 00:20:50.570
Of course not.
 It didn't suit you two at all.

00:20:50.570 --> 00:20:53.110
I'll just have to deal with it.

00:20:53.110 --> 00:20:55.610
I think it's better this way.

00:20:55.610 --> 00:20:58.760
I like the real Tenten better anyway.

00:20:58.760 --> 00:21:01.740
What made you change your mind, though?

00:21:02.230 --> 00:21:03.240
Well...

00:21:03.480 --> 00:21:07.990
<i>I've always depended on you because
I know how strong you are.</i>

00:21:08.870 --> 00:21:12.200
You don't know, Neji?

00:21:12.530 --> 00:21:13.670
It's so obvious.

00:21:13.670 --> 00:21:14.420
What?

00:21:14.720 --> 00:21:17.880
Attacks fatal to men 
don't affect women.

00:21:19.800 --> 00:21:22.410
Those soccer balls to the 
crotch showed Tenten...

00:21:22.410 --> 00:21:25.050
...that women are actually 
stronger than men!

00:21:25.440 --> 00:21:28.460
Ah, so she doesn't need 
us to protect her.

00:21:28.460 --> 00:21:32.420
Well, I know you boys can't 
endure that much pain,

00:21:32.420 --> 00:21:34.630
so I'll just have to protect you both!

00:21:35.900 --> 00:21:39.030
Are you kidding me?!

00:21:39.030 --> 00:21:40.620
Why me?!

00:21:41.100 --> 00:21:43.780
Hang in there, boys.

00:23:19.940 --> 00:23:28.710
<b>Guy Sensei Didn't Do It
 Guy Sensei's Rival is Kakashi Sensei</b>

00:23:20.920 --> 00:23:23.420
Everyone, next week's titles are:

00:23:23.420 --> 00:23:25.840
"Guy Sensei Didn't Do It,"

00:23:25.840 --> 00:23:28.710
and "Guy Sensei's Rival 
is Kakashi Sensei!"

00:23:28.710 --> 00:23:31.010
Guy Sensei's going to be on the show!

00:23:32.040 --> 00:23:34.810
Two straight men isn't going to cut it...
